<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued a total of 12 million American-style call and put warrants in 12 equal tranches on dollar/mark, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>The warrants all mature between September 1997 and December 1998. Payment date for the warrants is May 7, 1997. They are listed on the Frankfurt and Duesseldorf exchanges.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
